{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/overview.png?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the struggle for survival through the eyes of a restaurant owner in a small town under siege by monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research and sell delicious monster meat dishes and grow your Midwest restaurant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tPlace traps outside your restaurant to fend off unpredictable monster incursions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tMake difficult business decisions that ensure your survival or the destruction of Rapid City.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\tUnravel the mystery behind the monsters by diving into a deep narrative with characters that feel real.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How Far Will You Go to Keep Your Business Alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord and Facebook for more updates!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/defending.png?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/traps_gif_high.gif?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep BOTH your customers and business ALIVE by arming yourself, prepping your employees and setting up traps before the sun goes down\u2026. because who knows what the night will bring?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/cooking.png?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/ZOID_EYE-gif.gif?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make bizarre yet surprisingly delicious-looking monster dishes from monster meat! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different dishes have different effects on your customers, so it's up to you how to set your menu!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember - your choices have consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/busines.png?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/Business_Optimized.gif?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your success depends on your business decisions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Is profits all you care for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or do you put your community's welfare first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ultimately, your business decisions will determine your fate, and the fate of Rapid City.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/The_Story.png?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/extras/Story_Optimized.gif?t=1746607044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a small midwest town  suffering  a New Great Depression and a mysterious monster invasion, even a restaurant manager can make a difference.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know the customers and suppliers in Rapid City as you try to keep your restaurant afloat and uncover the mystery behind the origin of the monsters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1818480?t=1746607044","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746607044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746607044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1818480/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746607044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There will be some cartoon like monster violence"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\